    "privacyPolicyText": "Central Library Krishna Nagar collects only the essential personal information required for member registration, seat reservation, payment receipts, and library communication (such as full name, mobile number, email address, and academic category). We do not request unnecessary sensitive identification numbers such as Aadhaar by default. Member records are used solely for library administration and are never sold or shared with third-party marketers.",
    "termsText": "Membership at Central Library Krishna Nagar is personal and non-transferable. Members agree to maintain silence, keep mobile devices on silent mode, protect library furniture, and follow seat reservation and renewal policies. Operating hours are 7:00 AM – 10:00 PM unless notified otherwise through official library announcements. Management reserves the right to suspend accounts in case of repeated conduct violations.",
